<figure class="card">
  <div class="scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 920 570" role="img" aria-labelledby="cycleTitle cycleDesc">
      <title id="cycleTitle">The two motions of the work, and the path of one piece of work</title>
      <desc id="cycleDesc">A large loop split down the middle: the left half is “moving the graph”, the right half “moving the world”. Below it, six steps in a row (a gap, dialogue, a directive, a plan, work, evaluation), with new signals returning to the start.</desc>

      <path d="M460 57 A340 118 0 0 0 460 293" fill="none" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="2.2"></path>
      <path d="M460 293 A340 118 0 0 0 460 57" fill="none" stroke="#b45309" stroke-width="2.2"></path>
      <polygon points="112,166 128,166 120,184" fill="#0f766e"></polygon>
      <polygon points="792,184 808,184 800,166" fill="#b45309"></polygon>
      <line x1="460" y1="104" x2="460" y2="246" stroke="#c3ccd2" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4 5"></line>

      <text class="s-b" x="460" y="34" text-anchor="middle">something is noticed, and the turning starts again here</text>
      <text class="s-b" x="460" y="88" text-anchor="middle">it enters the shared picture</text>
      <text class="s-b" x="460" y="270" text-anchor="middle">what stands now asks for something to be done</text>

      <g>
        <text class="s-eyebrow-t" x="278" y="132" text-anchor="middle">MOVING THE GRAPH</text>
        <text class="s-b" x="278" y="154" text-anchor="middle">talking through gaps and questions,</text>
        <text class="s-b" x="278" y="170" text-anchor="middle">settling what we want, planning how</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="278" y="192" text-anchor="middle">bringing the picture closer to the project</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="278" y="206" text-anchor="middle">as it really is: work in its own right</text>
      </g>
      <g>
        <text class="s-eyebrow-a" x="642" y="132" text-anchor="middle">MOVING THE WORLD</text>
        <text class="s-b" x="642" y="154" text-anchor="middle">building it, doing it, saying it,</text>
        <text class="s-b" x="642" y="170" text-anchor="middle">putting it in front of people</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="642" y="192" text-anchor="middle">and whatever changes out there</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="642" y="206" text-anchor="middle">travels back as something newly noticed</text>
      </g>

      <line x1="14" y1="330" x2="906" y2="330" stroke="#e6eaec" stroke-width="1"></line>
      <text class="s-eyebrow" x="14" y="356">INSIDE THAT TURNING: THE PATH OF ONE PIECE OF WORK</text>

      <rect x="106" y="372" width="470" height="30" rx="8" fill="#f7f9fa" stroke="#c3ccd2" stroke-width="1.2"></rect>
      <text class="s-m" x="341" y="391" text-anchor="middle">anchored in: what we are aiming at &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; what we already committed to &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; how this team works</text>
      <line x1="232" y1="402" x2="232" y2="428" stroke="#c3ccd2" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></line>

      <g>
        <rect x="14" y="428" width="132" height="70" rx="10" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#c3ccd2" stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
        <text class="s-h2" x="26" y="452">a gap</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="26" y="470">something is off,</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="26" y="484">missing or newly true</text>

        <rect x="166" y="428" width="132" height="70" rx="10" fill="#f0f8f7" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
        <text class="s-h2" x="178" y="452">dialogue</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="178" y="470">you and the agent</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="178" y="484">shape it together</text>

        <rect x="318" y="428" width="132" height="70" rx="10" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#c3ccd2" stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
        <text class="s-h2" x="330" y="452">a directive</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="330" y="470">what we commit to,</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="330" y="484">with the reasoning</text>

        <rect x="470" y="428" width="132" height="70" rx="10" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#c3ccd2" stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
        <text class="s-h2" x="482" y="452">a plan</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="482" y="470">how it gets</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="482" y="484">carried out</text>

        <rect x="622" y="428" width="132" height="70" rx="10" fill="#fdf7ee" stroke="#b45309" stroke-width="1.6"></rect>
        <text class="s-h2" x="634" y="452">the work</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="634" y="470">part of it done</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="634" y="484">still counts as done</text>

        <rect x="774" y="428" width="132" height="70" rx="10" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#c3ccd2" stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
        <text class="s-h2" x="786" y="452">evaluation</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="786" y="470">checked by us,</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="786" y="484">tried by real people</text>
      </g>

      <g stroke="#52606d" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none">
        <line x1="148" y1="463" x2="163" y2="463" marker-end="url(#ar-slate)"></line>
        <line x1="300" y1="463" x2="315" y2="463" marker-end="url(#ar-slate)"></line>
        <line x1="452" y1="463" x2="467" y2="463" marker-end="url(#ar-slate)"></line>
        <line x1="604" y1="463" x2="619" y2="463" marker-end="url(#ar-slate)"></line>
        <line x1="756" y1="463" x2="771" y2="463" marker-end="url(#ar-slate)"></line>
      </g>

      <path d="M840 498 V 526 H 80 V 500" fill="none" stroke="#b45309" stroke-width="1.4" marker-end="url(#ar-amber)"></path>
      <rect x="330" y="512" width="260" height="28" rx="7" fill="#ffffff"></rect>
      <text class="s-b" x="460" y="531" text-anchor="middle">what we learn starts the next turn</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The path is not a queue to be emptied. Going forward beats finishing chunks: partial results land as real results, and what people tell us afterwards comes back in as something newly noticed.</figcaption>
</figure>

<figure class="card">
  <div class="scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 920 310" role="img" aria-labelledby="baTitle baDesc">
      <title id="baTitle">Before and after</title>
      <desc id="baDesc">On the left, four disconnected boxes (emails, meetings, documents, issue tracker) drifting apart, with one person as the only connector. On the right, one flow through the shared picture where each piece keeps its reasoning and its links.</desc>

      <line x1="460" y1="18" x2="460" y2="292" stroke="#e6eaec" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="5 5"></line>

      <text class="s-eyebrow" x="14" y="28">BEFORE: EVERY PLACE HOLDS A SLICE, AND THE SLICES DRIFT</text>

      <g stroke="#c3ccd2" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="3 4" fill="none">
        <path d="M150 106 C 200 88, 240 78, 285 78"></path>
        <path d="M345 100 C 350 140, 348 172, 345 200"></path>
        <path d="M82 106 C 60 140, 50 170, 60 196"></path>
        <path d="M142 218 C 190 226, 240 224, 285 222"></path>
      </g>

      <g>
        <rect x="30" y="62" width="120" height="44" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></rect>
        <text class="s-b" x="90" y="82" text-anchor="middle">emails</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="90" y="96" text-anchor="middle">a decision, in passing</text>

        <rect x="285" y="56" width="120" height="44" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></rect>
        <text class="s-b" x="345" y="76" text-anchor="middle">meetings</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="345" y="90" text-anchor="middle">the why, then gone</text>

        <rect x="22" y="196" width="120" height="44" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></rect>
        <text class="s-b" x="82" y="216" text-anchor="middle">documents</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="82" y="230" text-anchor="middle">true last quarter</text>

        <rect x="285" y="200" width="120" height="44" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-dasharray="5 4"></rect>
        <text class="s-b" x="345" y="220" text-anchor="middle">issue tracker</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="345" y="234" text-anchor="middle">the what, not the why</text>
      </g>

      <g stroke="#52606d" stroke-width="1.1" fill="none">
        <line x1="205" y1="140" x2="120" y2="98"></line>
        <line x1="228" y1="140" x2="300" y2="98"></line>
        <line x1="205" y1="164" x2="128" y2="202"></line>
        <line x1="228" y1="164" x2="300" y2="204"></line>
      </g>
      <circle cx="216" cy="140" r="11" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#3e4c59" stroke-width="1.6"></circle>
      <path d="M197 168 a19 19 0 0 1 38 0" fill="none" stroke="#3e4c59" stroke-width="1.6"></path>
      <text class="s-m" x="216" y="186" text-anchor="middle">one person holding</text>
      <text class="s-m" x="216" y="199" text-anchor="middle">it all together</text>
      <text class="s-note" x="14" y="278">Nothing here knows about anything else. The connections live in someone’s head.</text>

      <text class="s-eyebrow-t" x="492" y="28">AFTER: ONE FLOW, AND EVERY PIECE KEEPS ITS WHY</text>

      <g>
        <rect x="492" y="70" width="96" height="46" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
        <text class="s-b" x="540" y="90" text-anchor="middle">noticed</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="540" y="104" text-anchor="middle">by anyone</text>

        <rect x="606" y="70" width="96" height="46" rx="9" fill="#f0f8f7" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
        <text class="s-b" x="654" y="90" text-anchor="middle">talked</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="654" y="104" text-anchor="middle">through</text>

        <rect x="720" y="70" width="96" height="46" rx="9" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
        <text class="s-b" x="768" y="90" text-anchor="middle">decided</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="768" y="104" text-anchor="middle">and recorded</text>

        <rect x="812" y="140" width="96" height="46" rx="9" fill="#fdf7ee" stroke="#b45309" stroke-width="1.4"></rect>
        <text class="s-b" x="860" y="160" text-anchor="middle">done</text>
        <text class="s-m" x="860" y="174" text-anchor="middle">in the world</text>
      </g>

      <g stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.3" fill="none">
        <line x1="590" y1="93" x2="603" y2="93" marker-end="url(#ar-teal)"></line>
        <line x1="704" y1="93" x2="717" y2="93" marker-end="url(#ar-teal)"></line>
        <path d="M816 93 C 850 93, 860 112, 860 137" marker-end="url(#ar-teal)"></path>
      </g>

      <rect x="492" y="204" width="416" height="46" rx="10" fill="#f0f8f7" stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1.8"></rect>
      <use href="#mk-works" x="506" y="214" width="12" height="12"></use>
      <text class="s-b" x="526" y="223">the graph: one linked record, kept as it grows</text>
      <text class="s-m" x="526" y="240">each piece still carries the reasoning that produced it</text>

      <g stroke="#0f766e" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 3" fill="none">
        <line x1="540" y1="116" x2="540" y2="204"></line>
        <line x1="654" y1="116" x2="654" y2="204"></line>
        <line x1="768" y1="116" x2="768" y2="204"></line>
        <line x1="860" y1="186" x2="860" y2="204"></line>
      </g>
      <text class="s-note" x="492" y="278">Follow any piece and you can still see what it came from and what it changed.</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Many small loops turning at once, instead of sprint after sprint.</figcaption>
</figure>

